# Satori private registry access — TEMPLATE
#
# The Satori packages (@hylandsoftware/*, @hyland/*) are published to Hyland's
# private GitHub Packages registry. To install them:
#
# 1. Create a GitHub Personal Access Token (classic) with the `read:packages` scope.
# 2. Copy this file to `.npmrc` in this folder (agent-ng/).
# 3. Replace ${GITHUB_TOKEN} below with your token, OR set a GITHUB_TOKEN env var.
#
# The real `.npmrc` is gitignored so your token is never committed.

@hylandsoftware:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
@hyland:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
